_site/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Materialized by `knowledge-ctx use <profile>` on every dispatch into this repo
# (agents, skills, settings) — regenerated, never authored here, so it is not
# ours to commit.
#
# Added 2026-09-16 because nothing covered it. This machine's own global ignore
# (~/.config/git/ignore) hides `.claude/settings.local.json` and nothing else, so
# `git status` looked clean here while a fresh clone or a CI runner would have
# staged that file on `git add -A`. The rest of `.claude/` was never hidden at
# all. Runs have been dispatched against this repo (five on 2026-09-12), so the
# directory does get written; the signals repo showed the same gap the same day
# with 23 untracked files sitting in it.
#
# Nothing under `.claude/` is in this repo's history, so ignoring is sufficient —
# there is nothing to untrack.
.claude/
